  "name": "Signature Sleight",
  "type": "feat",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You have a particular technique that you favor when you impose upon fate. When you gain this feature, you gain a Diviner feat of 8th rank or lower that has the Sleight trait. Then, you choose a Sleight feat that you know to be your Signature Sleight. This Sleight gains a frequency of once per ten minutes if it has a lower or no frequency, and when you use this Sleight, you are not prevented from using any other Sleight in a ten minute timeframe. Any time you gain a new Sleight, you can retrain your selection automatically.</p>"
